{"batchcomplete":true,"query":{"pages":[{"pageid":677191,"ns":0,"title":"Differential (mathematics)","extract":"In mathematics, differential refers to several related notions derived from the early days of calculus, put on a rigorous footing, such as infinitesimal differences and the derivatives of functions.\nThe term is used in various branches of mathematics such as calculus, differential geometry, algebraic geometry and algebraic topology.","description":"Mathematical notion of infinitesimal difference","descriptionsource":"local"}]}}